。","requires_context":false,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":21,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[353,354]}},{"id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16-a","question_id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16","label":"ア","text":"Ｙは，甲に弁解の機会を与え，留置の必要があると判断すれば，平成２５年３月６日午後２時３５分までに裁判官に勾留を請求すれば足りる。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":false,"derivation":"combination","basis":"selected","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":22,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[372,373]}},{"id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16-b","question_id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16","label":"イ","text":"Ｙが，詐欺罪について甲を逮捕しないまま，窃盗罪の事実に詐欺罪の事実を併せて勾留請求した場合，勾留請求を受けた裁判官は，窃盗及び詐欺のいずれについても勾留の理由及び必要が認められるものと判断すれば，両罪について適法に勾留状を発することができる。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"convention","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":22,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[374,376]}},{"id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16-c","question_id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16","label":"ウ","text":"甲は，勾留請求を受けたＭ地方裁判所の裁判官が勾留状を発した場合，これに不服があるときは，同裁判所に対し，その裁判を取り消して勾留請求を却下するよう請求することができる。","requires_context":true,"truth_at_exam":{"value":true,"derivation":"combination","basis":"uniqueness","derived_from":{"slots":[{"no":22,"official_answer":2}]}},"truth_current":{"status":"unreviewed","value":null,"basis":null,"law_change_refs":[],"reviewed_by":null,"reviewed_at":null},"tags":{"articles":[],"topics":[]},"provenance":{"line_range":[377,380]}},{"id":"yobi-2015-keiso-q16-d